(6707537, 1002914, 108580, '<td valign="top">Great event imagery using the OOF Earth and hidden "Green" to portray despair and loneliness. <br/>In all honesty I wonder how much coal, oil and gas has been burned up lighting, heating, feeding, ferrying delegates by land, sea, air all over the world the past decade or more... and trees to print the flyers and material...</td>', 'Great event imagery using the OOF Earth and hidden "Green" to portray despair and loneliness. In all honesty I wonder how much coal, oil and gas has been burned up lighting, heating, feeding, ferrying delegates by land, sea, air all over the world the past decade or more... and trees to print the flyers and material...', '2012-03-12 01:36:12.000000', NULL, 1),
