(6707587, 1004025, 108580, '<td valign="top">This is an honest raw photo with little or no DPC formulae (angry busy blue sky, boosted colours, overly crisp), yet earthy tones, sharp and DOF. Perhaps the subject is a bit too central but that''s OK. It reminds of my slide days using Agfa or Fuji. Whilst the shot is no doubt contrived/setup, it''s appealing and DMC.</td>', 'This is an honest raw photo with little or no DPC formulae (angry busy blue sky, boosted colours, overly crisp), yet earthy tones, sharp and DOF. Perhaps the subject is a bit too central but that''s OK. It reminds of my slide days using Agfa or Fuji. Whilst the shot is no doubt contrived/setup, it''s appealing and DMC.', '2012-03-12 03:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6707597, 1003861, 114285, '<td valign="top">Wow very impactful the clothing, his darkened face, the way he is holding his teddy, and the grungey room he''s in.....you have my vote.</td>', 'Wow very impactful the clothing, his darkened face, the way he is holding his teddy, and the grungey room he''s in.....you have my vote.', '2012-03-12 04:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
