(6707898, 1002959, 134859, '<td valign="top">Beautifully executed.  Love the over/under exposure here (guess that''s what you would call it?)  Anyways... the little hole in the back, the angle shot, the lighting, the color... it all works perfectly!  It''s like the bear is longing for his old pal to come back to him.  Great capture!</td>', 'Beautifully executed.  Love the over/under exposure here (guess that''s what you would call it?)  Anyways... the little hole in the back, the angle shot, the lighting, the color... it all works perfectly!  It''s like the bear is longing for his old pal to come back to him.  Great capture!', '2012-03-12 11:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6707901, 1003997, 134859, '<td valign="top">A very sad message conveyed.  <br/>Lovely catch and set up.  The little boy''s head is a little OOF.  But a great "real life" capture.</td>', 'A very sad message conveyed.  Lovely catch and set up.  The little boy''s head is a little OOF.  But a great "real life" capture.', '2012-03-12 12:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6707904, 1004003, 134859, '<td valign="top">Sad, sad message.  <br/> <br/>Great lighting for this shot.  Anything brighter and it would have been too much... the darkness portrays just that... darkness.  <br/> <br/>Love the hand... even though it looks almost amputated... it is a nice set up.  Looks realistic.  <br/>Executed nicely.</td>', 'Sad, sad message.   Great lighting for this shot.  Anything brighter and it would have been too much... the darkness portrays just that... darkness.   Love the hand... even though it looks almost amputated... it is a nice set up.  Looks realistic.  Executed nicely.', '2012-03-12 12:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6707907, 1003973, 134859, '<td valign="top">A lonely shot.  A starving musician, perhaps?  Feeling like giving up on his music because no one "gets him".  <br/>That''s the message I receive... that he''s ready to leave, to give up... but he''s contemplating it.  <br/> <br/>A little sharper detail on the model, and it would have been perfect.  It seems that the right side of the track/rail is more in focus than the actual subject of the photograph.  <br/> <br/>Overall, very well done!  9</td>', 'A lonely shot.  A starving musician, perhaps?  Feeling like giving up on his music because no one "gets him".  That''s the message I receive... that he''s ready to leave, to give up... but he''s contemplating it.   A little sharper detail on the model, and it would have been perfect.  It seems that the right side of the track/rail is more in focus than the actual subject of the photograph.   Overall, very well done!  9', '2012-03-12 12:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
