(6707968, 1004026, 143086, '<td valign="top">This sort of missed the mark for me. Technically pretty good, but doesn''t speak to me.<br/> <br/>As an aside: when I see a photo of glass, it bugs me when I can see the stuff behind the camera in the reflection (unless it seems on purpose). I think a backdrop behind you would help a lot (if possible)</td>', 'This sort of missed the mark for me. Technically pretty good, but doesn''t speak to me. As an aside: when I see a photo of glass, it bugs me when I can see the stuff behind the camera in the reflection (unless it seems on purpose). I think a backdrop behind you would help a lot (if possible)', '2012-03-12 13:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
