(6707973, 1003992, 134859, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF and color.  Love the fact that it is way off in the distance... great "lonely" feeling.  Nice processing and wonderful capture!</td>', 'Nice DOF and color.  Love the fact that it is way off in the distance... great "lonely" feeling.  Nice processing and wonderful capture!', '2012-03-12 13:40:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6707974, 1003909, 134859, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot.  The processing is amazing.  I''m sure there will be people who think it''s over done, but I think it works well with this particular image.  Not sure what that is in the middle of the posts, but it does portray a feeling of loneliness, especially given the title.</td>', 'Lovely shot.  The processing is amazing.  I''m sure there will be people who think it''s over done, but I think it works well with this particular image.  Not sure what that is in the middle of the posts, but it does portray a feeling of loneliness, especially given the title.', '2012-03-12 13:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6707976, 1003861, 134859, '<td valign="top">This is such a sad and emotional shot.  The title emphasizes that fact.  The lighting is perfectly executed.  It''s almost like he''s unwanted, locked in a basement.  The expression on his face is great... the stance, the way he''s holding the teddy bear (?).  It''s all perfectly done!  10</td>', 'This is such a sad and emotional shot.  The title emphasizes that fact.  The lighting is perfectly executed.  It''s almost like he''s unwanted, locked in a basement.  The expression on his face is great... the stance, the way he''s holding the teddy bear (?).  It''s all perfectly done!  10', '2012-03-12 13:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6707978, 1002943, 143086, '<td valign="top">perfect tones</td>', 'perfect tones', '2012-03-12 13:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6707981, 1003908, 134859, '<td valign="top">Originally, my eyes focused on the brightly colored cross in the middle of the photo, afterwards, I noticed the woman.  I think perhaps if the focal point (or even coloring) was more on the woman, rather than that particular subject (the cross in the middle), it would have made for a better photo, but that''s just my opinion.  <br/> <br/>The fact that all the tombstones are asymmetrical and off balance makes for a nice effect.  There is a decent DOF in the photo.  And the title is well done.  <br/> <br/>Overall, a good photo, but *I* feel with a few adjustments, it could have been even better.</td>', 'Originally, my eyes focused on the brightly colored cross in the middle of the photo, afterwards, I noticed the woman.  I think perhaps if the focal point (or even coloring) was more on the woman, rather than that particular subject (the cross in the middle), it would have made for a better photo, but that''s just my opinion.   The fact that all the tombstones are asymmetrical and off balance makes for a nice effect.  There is a decent DOF in the photo.  And the title is well done.   Overall, a good photo, but *I* feel with a few adjustments, it could have been even better.', '2012-03-12 13:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6707998, 1003921, 134859, '<td valign="top">The colors are nice and vibrant.  I think that what''s throwing me off is the un-levelness of the cage.  <br/>I like the title, fitting.  And a nice close up.  <br/>Did you try taking the picture at a further distance?  Sometimes that helps with the composition of an image as well.  I know there are many pictures that I wish I would have just taken a few steps back, while others that I should have taken a few closer.  <br/>Overall, nice entry.</td>', 'The colors are nice and vibrant.  I think that what''s throwing me off is the un-levelness of the cage.  I like the title, fitting.  And a nice close up.  Did you try taking the picture at a further distance?  Sometimes that helps with the composition of an image as well.  I know there are many pictures that I wish I would have just taken a few steps back, while others that I should have taken a few closer.  Overall, nice entry.', '2012-03-12 14:21:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6707999, 1003836, 134859, '<td valign="top">I almost did something similar to this with my daughter as the model.  Great focus!  Love the colors, it helps to portray that lonely feeling.  Nicely executed.</td>', 'I almost did something similar to this with my daughter as the model.  Great focus!  Love the colors, it helps to portray that lonely feeling.  Nicely executed.', '2012-03-12 14:22:20.000000', NULL, 1),
