(6708004, 1003918, 134859, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Love the reds and oranges.  Beautifully done with the black foreground.</td>', 'Nice shot.  Love the reds and oranges.  Beautifully done with the black foreground.', '2012-03-12 14:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708006, 1003882, 134859, '<td valign="top">Absolutely love this shot!  As soon as I saw it, instantly, I thought 10!  <br/>The DOF is well done, the detail on the bear is great.  Love the colors and the lighting.  The position of the bear, as if someone just threw it out like it''s old junk.  Great shot.  Lovely angle.  Perfectly done!</td>', 'Absolutely love this shot!  As soon as I saw it, instantly, I thought 10!  The DOF is well done, the detail on the bear is great.  Love the colors and the lighting.  The position of the bear, as if someone just threw it out like it''s old junk.  Great shot.  Lovely angle.  Perfectly done!', '2012-03-12 14:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708008, 1003726, 134859, '<td valign="top">Very pretty girl.  Like the bokeh.  Nicely executed.  The stray hairs in the back could have been cloned out, as for the few stray in the front.  I think that perhaps a slight more angle (facing closer to the photographer) would have been good.  I don''t feel the sense of loneliness, maybe if she was hanging her head slightly?  But I think it''s a great photo overall.  Nicely done!</td>', 'Very pretty girl.  Like the bokeh.  Nicely executed.  The stray hairs in the back could have been cloned out, as for the few stray in the front.  I think that perhaps a slight more angle (facing closer to the photographer) would have been good.  I don''t feel the sense of loneliness, maybe if she was hanging her head slightly?  But I think it''s a great photo overall.  Nicely done!', '2012-03-12 14:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
