(6708058, 1003333, 140777, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice picture!<br/> <br/>IMHO the colors are too worm to give the feeling of "Alone" (the soft red of the building, the yellow brown stairs and the light blue shirt).<br/>Maybe if it was more grayish then I would have felt more loneliness here.</td>', 'It''s a nice picture! IMHO the colors are too worm to give the feeling of "Alone" (the soft red of the building, the yellow brown stairs and the light blue shirt).Maybe if it was more grayish then I would have felt more loneliness here.', '2012-03-12 15:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
