(6708062, 1003969, 140777, '<td valign="top">Great title!</td>', 'Great title!', '2012-03-12 15:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708063, 1003669, 134859, '<td valign="top">Love the processing on this shot.  It''s over the top, yet it still works.  <br/>Great lonely feeling.  Nice title!  Very well done.</td>', 'Love the processing on this shot.  It''s over the top, yet it still works.  Great lonely feeling.  Nice title!  Very well done.', '2012-03-12 15:07:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708065, 1003998, 134859, '<td valign="top">Love this black and white!  Great DOF.  Nice detail throughout the rest of the photo.  Sadly, the daffodil looks like someone has trampled on it.  Very well shot and processed</td>', 'Love this black and white!  Great DOF.  Nice detail throughout the rest of the photo.  Sadly, the daffodil looks like someone has trampled on it.  Very well shot and processed', '2012-03-12 15:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708066, 1003857, 134859, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Like the way the model is completely blacked out.  The sunshine on the water hits a little hard, but it''s still a very well composed and processed photo.</td>', 'Nice shot.  Like the way the model is completely blacked out.  The sunshine on the water hits a little hard, but it''s still a very well composed and processed photo.', '2012-03-12 15:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708070, 1003861, 140777, '<td valign="top">Wow.. strong image and title. I''m not sure if it''s loneliness that I''m getting from it, but still, great work!</td>', 'Wow.. strong image and title. I''m not sure if it''s loneliness that I''m getting from it, but still, great work!', '2012-03-12 15:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708076, 1002928, 134859, '<td valign="top">This is a nice photo.  It''s a little dark for my taste, I think it''s the dark foreground against the very light sky?  <br/>Also, very soft, which I think this picture would look better if it was more detailed.  But of course, that''s just my personal opinion.  <br/> <br/>Still a nice shot.</td>', 'This is a nice photo.  It''s a little dark for my taste, I think it''s the dark foreground against the very light sky?  Also, very soft, which I think this picture would look better if it was more detailed.  But of course, that''s just my personal opinion.   Still a nice shot.', '2012-03-12 15:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708120, 1004003, 144746, '<td valign="top">That''s a bit morbid...</td>', 'That''s a bit morbid...', '2012-03-12 15:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708122, 1003861, 109387, '<td valign="top">A little too dark, but I love it. 9.<br/> <br/>ETA: I bump it to 10, I love it!</td>', 'A little too dark, but I love it. 9. ETA: I bump it to 10, I love it!', '2012-03-12 16:00:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708125, 1003851, 86447, '<td valign="top">I really like this image.<br/> <br/> <br/> <br/>(commenting only)</td>', 'I really like this image.   (commenting only)', '2012-03-12 16:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708127, 1003754, 134859, '<td valign="top">Nicely processed.  The colors are beautiful.  The image is nicely composed.  Very well done.</td>', 'Nicely processed.  The colors are beautiful.  The image is nicely composed.  Very well done.', '2012-03-12 16:15:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708140, 1003984, 142599, '<td valign="top">OK thats just to cute and funny ... love it !</td>', 'OK thats just to cute and funny ... love it !', '2012-03-12 16:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708157, 1003997, 124190, '<td valign="top">Please tell us what happened to her.....10</td>', 'Please tell us what happened to her.....10', '2012-03-12 16:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708162, 1003922, 142599, '<td valign="top">love the lighting and clarity of this picture . great job !</td>', 'love the lighting and clarity of this picture . great job !', '2012-03-12 17:01:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708164, 1003426, 142599, '<td valign="top">He looks so sad ! love that you did it in B&amp;W ,really captures the loneliness...</td>', 'He looks so sad ! love that you did it in B&W ,really captures the loneliness...', '2012-03-12 17:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708165, 1002959, 142599, '<td valign="top">Sad but true... :(     wonderful image ! also love that the teddy is looking out the window .</td>', 'Sad but true... :(     wonderful image ! also love that the teddy is looking out the window .', '2012-03-12 17:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708166, 1003861, 142599, '<td valign="top">This picture gives me the chills, it says so much and I think you did an excellent job in catching the raw emotion of this challenge . It freaks me out to know that there are children that go through terrible , horrible things like this image has captured . 10 <br/> <br/>On a lighter note... Cute Boy , Yours ?</td>', 'This picture gives me the chills, it says so much and I think you did an excellent job in catching the raw emotion of this challenge . It freaks me out to know that there are children that go through terrible , horrible things like this image has captured . 10  On a lighter note... Cute Boy , Yours ?', '2012-03-12 17:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708199, 1003999, 108580, '<td valign="top">DMC, very nice image. Just simple and appealing.</td>', 'DMC, very nice image. Just simple and appealing.', '2012-03-12 17:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708212, 1004003, 137576, '<td valign="top">my kind of shot :) great light and feeling</td>', 'my kind of shot :) great light and feeling', '2012-03-12 18:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708243, 1003847, 142615, '<td valign="top">amazing moooor than 10 i love it</td>', 'amazing moooor than 10 i love it', '2012-03-12 19:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708247, 1003585, 124982, '<td valign="top">Interesting processing. Looks to be a Robert touch?</td>', 'Interesting processing. Looks to be a Robert touch?', '2012-03-12 19:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708318, 1003851, 38921, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the sharpness of the bird.  I find the reflections in the water and the blown highlights on the one leaf are a bit distracting. All in all still a good shot, 6.</td>', 'I like the composition and the sharpness of the bird.  I find the reflections in the water and the blown highlights on the one leaf are a bit distracting. All in all still a good shot, 6.', '2012-03-12 21:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708323, 1003426, 38921, '<td valign="top">Fantastic, I just wish the spot on the left cheek wasn''t there.  I''m guessing it may have been too difficult to clone out.</td>', 'Fantastic, I just wish the spot on the left cheek wasn''t there.  I''m guessing it may have been too difficult to clone out.', '2012-03-12 22:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708347, 1003712, 14001, '<td valign="top">Great shot, the lighting, eye catching model, and the sky.  Plus you create the feeling of something greater lurking in the darkness.  Well done, 10.</td>', 'Great shot, the lighting, eye catching model, and the sky.  Plus you create the feeling of something greater lurking in the darkness.  Well done, 10.', '2012-03-12 22:39:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708348, 1004047, 14001, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 10 because it really does convey the feeling of being alone, plus the quality of the image is excellent as well.</td>', 'I gave this a 10 because it really does convey the feeling of being alone, plus the quality of the image is excellent as well.', '2012-03-12 22:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708350, 1003305, 14001, '<td valign="top">I like the juxtaposition of the colors.</td>', 'I like the juxtaposition of the colors.', '2012-03-12 22:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708352, 1003860, 14001, '<td valign="top">I really like this image, I would love it I think if the house wasn''t centered.  I do like the fact of how you introduced a foreground idea.  I gave it a nine.</td>', 'I really like this image, I would love it I think if the house wasn''t centered.  I do like the fact of how you introduced a foreground idea.  I gave it a nine.', '2012-03-12 22:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708353, 1003443, 14001, '<td valign="top">Aptly named.  Nice capture.</td>', 'Aptly named.  Nice capture.', '2012-03-12 22:47:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708355, 1003857, 14001, '<td valign="top">Don''t understand the title (or like it for that matter), but I really like the image.  I get the feeling that the colors were not post-processed.  Thanks.</td>', 'Don''t understand the title (or like it for that matter), but I really like the image.  I get the feeling that the colors were not post-processed.  Thanks.', '2012-03-12 22:49:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708357, 1003753, 14001, '<td valign="top">Creates a really interesting feeling.  Nice choice of black and white.</td>', 'Creates a really interesting feeling.  Nice choice of black and white.', '2012-03-12 22:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708358, 1003372, 14001, '<td valign="top">I wish he was fishing!  But really nice none-the-less, thanks!</td>', 'I wish he was fishing!  But really nice none-the-less, thanks!', '2012-03-12 22:50:51.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(6708361, 1004014, 14001, '<td valign="top">Nice feeling of being alone.  I cannot help but wonder what it would have looked like with stronger depth of field, to where she maybe gets lost in the image, but this was your interpretation (not mine)!  Nice capture!</td>', 'Nice feeling of being alone.  I cannot help but wonder what it would have looked like with stronger depth of field, to where she maybe gets lost in the image, but this was your interpretation (not mine)!  Nice capture!', '2012-03-12 22:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708363, 1003309, 14001, '<td valign="top">She really has a lot on her mind. Nice idea, and nice capture!  10!</td>', 'She really has a lot on her mind. Nice idea, and nice capture!  10!', '2012-03-12 22:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708364, 1003806, 144287, '<td valign="top">You just took this? Incredible. Definitely conveys the theme of solitude.</td>', 'You just took this? Incredible. Definitely conveys the theme of solitude.', '2012-03-12 22:55:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708365, 1003585, 14001, '<td valign="top">Quality of the image is outstanding.  Doesn''t convey solitude to me, but more tranquility.  Nice looking image.</td>', 'Quality of the image is outstanding.  Doesn''t convey solitude to me, but more tranquility.  Nice looking image.', '2012-03-12 22:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708366, 1003854, 144287, '<td valign="top">Cute, but it doesn''t convey loneliness or solitude strongly enough to me.</td>', 'Cute, but it doesn''t convey loneliness or solitude strongly enough to me.', '2012-03-12 22:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708367, 1003753, 144287, '<td valign="top">Well done. Very well done.</td>', 'Well done. Very well done.', '2012-03-12 22:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708368, 1004016, 144287, '<td valign="top">Yeah, I can feel it here. Despair, too.</td>', 'Yeah, I can feel it here. Despair, too.', '2012-03-12 22:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708369, 1003947, 144287, '<td valign="top">If it wasn''t for the title, I might not have sensed loneliness here. Solitude, yes.</td>', 'If it wasn''t for the title, I might not have sensed loneliness here. Solitude, yes.', '2012-03-12 22:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708371, 1002675, 144287, '<td valign="top">Almost too far away but I can see solitude there.</td>', 'Almost too far away but I can see solitude there.', '2012-03-12 22:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708373, 1003937, 144287, '<td valign="top">Nice photo but not strongly linked to the theme.</td>', 'Nice photo but not strongly linked to the theme.', '2012-03-12 23:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708374, 1003909, 144287, '<td valign="top">Interesting but not especially evocative.</td>', 'Interesting but not especially evocative.', '2012-03-12 23:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708375, 1003807, 144287, '<td valign="top">Sorry, kinda misses the theme for me.</td>', 'Sorry, kinda misses the theme for me.', '2012-03-12 23:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708376, 1003077, 144287, '<td valign="top">Misses the theme, I think.</td>', 'Misses the theme, I think.', '2012-03-12 23:02:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708377, 1003310, 144287, '<td valign="top">No, this misses the theme. I don''t sense loneliness or solitude here.</td>', 'No, this misses the theme. I don''t sense loneliness or solitude here.', '2012-03-12 23:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708379, 1004015, 144287, '<td valign="top">This really works. It shouts loneliness.</td>', 'This really works. It shouts loneliness.', '2012-03-12 23:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708381, 1002943, 144287, '<td valign="top">Yes. If you''re out there on those rocks with the violent surf, you''re feeling alone and weak.</td>', 'Yes. If you''re out there on those rocks with the violent surf, you''re feeling alone and weak.', '2012-03-12 23:05:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708382, 1003920, 144287, '<td valign="top">Okay, this is unusual as heel. Good for 8 points.</td>', 'Okay, this is unusual as heel. Good for 8 points.', '2012-03-12 23:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708383, 1004002, 144287, '<td valign="top">Okay, yes, good job. You made it interesting with the selective color. More points for that.</td>', 'Okay, yes, good job. You made it interesting with the selective color. More points for that.', '2012-03-12 23:08:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708384, 1004007, 144287, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, it''s just too staged for me to offer high points. Good for a 6.</td>', 'I''m sorry, it''s just too staged for me to offer high points. Good for a 6.', '2012-03-12 23:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708387, 1003729, 144287, '<td valign="top">Strong.</td>', 'Strong.', '2012-03-12 23:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708388, 1003221, 144287, '<td valign="top">Man, I wanted to see his expression more than his feet. 9 minus 2 for the misplaced focus equals 7.</td>', 'Man, I wanted to see his expression more than his feet. 9 minus 2 for the misplaced focus equals 7.', '2012-03-12 23:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708390, 1003878, 144287, '<td valign="top">Very nice photograph. The sense of solitude comes from putting myself in the place of the photographer - being out there late in the afternoon, alone.</td>', 'Very nice photograph. The sense of solitude comes from putting myself in the place of the photographer - being out there late in the afternoon, alone.', '2012-03-12 23:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708391, 1003633, 144287, '<td valign="top">What is that?</td>', 'What is that?', '2012-03-12 23:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708392, 1003969, 144287, '<td valign="top">Nailed it.</td>', 'Nailed it.', '2012-03-12 23:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708393, 1003997, 144287, '<td valign="top">This is a very personal photograph.</td>', 'This is a very personal photograph.', '2012-03-12 23:16:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708394, 1004040, 144287, '<td valign="top">This didn''t connect to the theme strongly enough for me.</td>', 'This didn''t connect to the theme strongly enough for me.', '2012-03-12 23:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708395, 1003847, 144287, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo, no doubt, but doesn''t connect strongly to the theme.</td>', 'Interesting photo, no doubt, but doesn''t connect strongly to the theme.', '2012-03-12 23:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708396, 1003836, 144287, '<td valign="top">Excellent.</td>', 'Excellent.', '2012-03-12 23:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708397, 1003914, 144287, '<td valign="top">Missing a strong focal point. If this had a person or single animal in the shot it would have had more strength.</td>', 'Missing a strong focal point. If this had a person or single animal in the shot it would have had more strength.', '2012-03-12 23:20:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708400, 1003924, 144287, '<td valign="top">Yeah, the angle of his head, looking down the sidewalk, really works. Don''t care about the diner lady. Just him.</td>', 'Yeah, the angle of his head, looking down the sidewalk, really works. Don''t care about the diner lady. Just him.', '2012-03-12 23:22:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708402, 1003954, 144287, '<td valign="top">Damn, it''s too hard for me to tell what he''s holding and that distracts me. Don''t know that the blurred vignette adds much.</td>', 'Damn, it''s too hard for me to tell what he''s holding and that distracts me. Don''t know that the blurred vignette adds much.', '2012-03-12 23:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708403, 1003564, 144287, '<td valign="top">The chain, painful. Good job.</td>', 'The chain, painful. Good job.', '2012-03-12 23:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708406, 1003947, 20115, '<td valign="top">Beautiful silhouette--strange how it looks like Peter Fonda in Easy Rider!</td>', 'Beautiful silhouette--strange how it looks like Peter Fonda in Easy Rider!', '2012-03-12 23:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708408, 1003908, 20115, '<td valign="top">With some of her friends no doubt and hopefully not feeling as alone as it seems.  I like the texture--just not sure of the green.</td>', 'With some of her friends no doubt and hopefully not feeling as alone as it seems.  I like the texture--just not sure of the green.', '2012-03-12 23:27:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708409, 1003620, 144287, '<td valign="top">There are so many other subjects that are stronger than a "daffy" for conveying the theme of this particular challenge.</td>', 'There are so many other subjects that are stronger than a "daffy" for conveying the theme of this particular challenge.', '2012-03-12 23:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708412, 1003837, 144287, '<td valign="top">I expected more graveyard shots to be entered. The tint adds some interest, I guess.</td>', 'I expected more graveyard shots to be entered. The tint adds some interest, I guess.', '2012-03-12 23:28:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708413, 1003850, 20115, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a place.  Beautiful.</td>', 'Wow, what a place.  Beautiful.', '2012-03-12 23:28:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708415, 1003753, 114285, '<td valign="top">Very cute as usual.</td>', 'Very cute as usual.', '2012-03-12 23:29:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708416, 1003666, 144287, '<td valign="top">Kinda good. It''s the watchful eye and the monotone that makes it work.</td>', 'Kinda good. It''s the watchful eye and the monotone that makes it work.', '2012-03-12 23:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708417, 1002907, 20115, '<td valign="top">But he has someone to bring flowers to--that''s good.  Love the texture.</td>', 'But he has someone to bring flowers to--that''s good.  Love the texture.', '2012-03-12 23:29:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708418, 1003928, 144287, '<td valign="top">This is a hard subject to photograph and get right. Good on ya.</td>', 'This is a hard subject to photograph and get right. Good on ya.', '2012-03-12 23:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708419, 1003837, 20115, '<td valign="top">I don''t get the theme "alone" from this.  Unless the person who took the photo is alone after being left behind.  Not crazy about the deep rose sky.</td>', 'I don''t get the theme "alone" from this.  Unless the person who took the photo is alone after being left behind.  Not crazy about the deep rose sky.', '2012-03-12 23:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708421, 1003333, 144287, '<td valign="top">Yes, two handfuls of points for you.</td>', 'Yes, two handfuls of points for you.', '2012-03-12 23:31:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708422, 1003949, 20115, '<td valign="top">Feels very dark and lonely.  I like it--the lighting effective.</td>', 'Feels very dark and lonely.  I like it--the lighting effective.', '2012-03-12 23:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708423, 1002959, 144287, '<td valign="top">Jeez, I don''t know about this. It''s a creepy little bear but does convey a loneliness. Evocative.</td>', 'Jeez, I don''t know about this. It''s a creepy little bear but does convey a loneliness. Evocative.', '2012-03-12 23:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708424, 1003847, 20115, '<td valign="top">amazing photograph--is that a real mosquito?  Coloring is great too.  I have to learn how to do that.</td>', 'amazing photograph--is that a real mosquito?  Coloring is great too.  I have to learn how to do that.', '2012-03-12 23:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708425, 1003929, 20115, '<td valign="top">love the colors and texture in this--like a painting and very beautiful pear with the leaves still on--perfect.</td>', 'love the colors and texture in this--like a painting and very beautiful pear with the leaves still on--perfect.', '2012-03-12 23:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708426, 1003305, 144287, '<td valign="top">It''s kind of a strange set up, you have to admit, but the isolated color adds interest.</td>', 'It''s kind of a strange set up, you have to admit, but the isolated color adds interest.', '2012-03-12 23:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708427, 1003309, 20115, '<td valign="top">Beautiful girl, beautiful day.  I guess we are all alone in a crowd.</td>', 'Beautiful girl, beautiful day.  I guess we are all alone in a crowd.', '2012-03-12 23:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708428, 1003209, 144287, '<td valign="top">You just took this? For this challenge? Fortuitous. Nice photo.</td>', 'You just took this? For this challenge? Fortuitous. Nice photo.', '2012-03-12 23:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708430, 1002675, 20115, '<td valign="top">This looks a little more scary to me than blissful--but that depends upon who you are I guess.  Either way it is pretty dramatic for sure.</td>', 'This looks a little more scary to me than blissful--but that depends upon who you are I guess.  Either way it is pretty dramatic for sure.', '2012-03-12 23:35:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708431, 1004015, 20115, '<td valign="top">Very powerful.</td>', 'Very powerful.', '2012-03-12 23:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708432, 1003921, 144287, '<td valign="top">Very well photographed. A beautiful animal. But, it''s so closely cropped that I don''t get a strong sense of "aloneness."</td>', 'Very well photographed. A beautiful animal. But, it''s so closely cropped that I don''t get a strong sense of "aloneness."', '2012-03-12 23:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708433, 1003951, 144287, '<td valign="top">Very artistic. Impressionistic. More points for that.</td>', 'Very artistic. Impressionistic. More points for that.', '2012-03-12 23:37:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708434, 1003969, 20115, '<td valign="top">The B&amp;W is just great here.  I think I would have composed it a little differently, but sometimes that is not possible when photographing someone.  Very nice.</td>', 'The B&W is just great here.  I think I would have composed it a little differently, but sometimes that is not possible when photographing someone.  Very nice.', '2012-03-12 23:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708435, 1002907, 144287, '<td valign="top">This makes me think and wonder. Good job.</td>', 'This makes me think and wonder. Good job.', '2012-03-12 23:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708436, 1003753, 20115, '<td valign="top">Ahhhh...poor kitty.  I like this a lot.</td>', 'Ahhhh...poor kitty.  I like this a lot.', '2012-03-12 23:38:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708437, 1004014, 144287, '<td valign="top">One of the better ones.</td>', 'One of the better ones.', '2012-03-12 23:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708438, 1003997, 20115, '<td valign="top">A little spooky for sure.</td>', 'A little spooky for sure.', '2012-03-12 23:39:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708439, 1003850, 144287, '<td valign="top">Very unusual.</td>', 'Very unusual.', '2012-03-12 23:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6708441, 1003972, 20115, '<td valign="top">I don''t get this--sorry--and it is out of focus--perhaps on purpose.</td>', 'I don''t get this--sorry--and it is out of focus--perhaps on purpose.', '2012-03-12 23:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
