(6710863, 1003969, 134859, '<td valign="top">Love the black and white.  Especially the brightness of the papers the old man is writing on.  Makes me wonder what he''s working on.  <br/>The only thing that bothers me with the photo is the blurred right bottom corner and upper left corner.  Other than that, this photo is fantastic!</td>', 'Love the black and white.  Especially the brightness of the papers the old man is writing on.  Makes me wonder what he''s working on.  The only thing that bothers me with the photo is the blurred right bottom corner and upper left corner.  Other than that, this photo is fantastic!', '2012-03-15 08:48:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710864, 1002907, 134859, '<td valign="top">Great title.  Love that there''s not another person in sight, no cars, nothing.  Makes for a wonderful composition!  The colors are dreary, which adds to the picture.  The pp is well done.</td>', 'Great title.  Love that there''s not another person in sight, no cars, nothing.  Makes for a wonderful composition!  The colors are dreary, which adds to the picture.  The pp is well done.', '2012-03-15 08:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710866, 1003607, 134859, '<td valign="top">Brings back memories of going to visit these types of walls many, many times.  The person in the back, sitting all alone, perhaps reminiscing, having a moment of silence, remember... It''s a great add to the photo!  Love the black and white conversion!</td>', 'Brings back memories of going to visit these types of walls many, many times.  The person in the back, sitting all alone, perhaps reminiscing, having a moment of silence, remember... It''s a great add to the photo!  Love the black and white conversion!', '2012-03-15 08:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710867, 1004014, 134859, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Uncluttered.  Great choice for a black and white.  The model looks sad, like she''s waiting on someone that isn''t going to show.  Love the detail of the foreground.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Nice shot.  Uncluttered.  Great choice for a black and white.  The model looks sad, like she''s waiting on someone that isn''t going to show.  Love the detail of the foreground.  Nicely done.', '2012-03-15 08:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710868, 1003920, 134859, '<td valign="top">Dark and dreary picture... works well with this challenge.  Love the color and pp that was done here!  The details of the building to the right work great in contrast with the simplicity of the main subject.  Wonderfully done.</td>', 'Dark and dreary picture... works well with this challenge.  Love the color and pp that was done here!  The details of the building to the right work great in contrast with the simplicity of the main subject.  Wonderfully done.', '2012-03-15 08:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710871, 1003257, 134859, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  Love the detail of the clouds.  The slight vignette works wonderfully here.  It makes it appear to be a very lonely photo.  Nice job!</td>', 'Great shot.  Love the detail of the clouds.  The slight vignette works wonderfully here.  It makes it appear to be a very lonely photo.  Nice job!', '2012-03-15 08:53:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710873, 1004015, 134859, '<td valign="top">This is a very creative idea.  Like what you''ve done here.  It''s almost like a portrayal of a schizophrenic person.  Wonderful idea!</td>', 'This is a very creative idea.  Like what you''ve done here.  It''s almost like a portrayal of a schizophrenic person.  Wonderful idea!', '2012-03-15 08:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710874, 1004031, 134859, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  The owl almost blends right in with the tree.  Great camouflage for him, lol.  Simplistic, yet detailed.</td>', 'Nice shot.  The owl almost blends right in with the tree.  Great camouflage for him, lol.  Simplistic, yet detailed.', '2012-03-15 08:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710876, 1003995, 134859, '<td valign="top">Love the colors, the lighting, the darkness... everything about it screams loneliness.</td>', 'Love the colors, the lighting, the darkness... everything about it screams loneliness.', '2012-03-15 08:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710877, 1004049, 134859, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  I can see the link of loneliness.  The main thing that bothers me in this photo is the dust on the board.  Perhaps if it was cloned out, it wouldn''t be so distracting.  Good shot, however.</td>', 'Nice idea.  I can see the link of loneliness.  The main thing that bothers me in this photo is the dust on the board.  Perhaps if it was cloned out, it wouldn''t be so distracting.  Good shot, however.', '2012-03-15 08:55:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710878, 1003851, 134859, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot.  A little bright, but a good shot.  Like the way the picture was composed.  And the bird is very colorful, which adds to the picture.</td>', 'Lovely shot.  A little bright, but a good shot.  Like the way the picture was composed.  And the bird is very colorful, which adds to the picture.', '2012-03-15 08:56:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710879, 1003729, 134859, '<td valign="top">Good portrayal of being left.  I like how the light is shining through, the darkness of the model and foreground work great.  The only thing that throws me off is that slight red tint in the background... a cup perhaps?  Other than that, it''s nicely done.</td>', 'Good portrayal of being left.  I like how the light is shining through, the darkness of the model and foreground work great.  The only thing that throws me off is that slight red tint in the background... a cup perhaps?  Other than that, it''s nicely done.', '2012-03-15 08:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710882, 1003633, 134859, '<td valign="top">Still haven''t figured out what this is, no matter how many times I look at it, I cannot figure it out for the life of me.  lol.  I like the smoothness of the object, the contrast of the colors.  It''s very simplistic, but it works well.  The shadow is a nice touch.  The top of the object is a little blurred, which makes me wonder why, but other than that, it''s a great shot.  Very interesting.</td>', 'Still haven''t figured out what this is, no matter how many times I look at it, I cannot figure it out for the life of me.  lol.  I like the smoothness of the object, the contrast of the colors.  It''s very simplistic, but it works well.  The shadow is a nice touch.  The top of the object is a little blurred, which makes me wonder why, but other than that, it''s a great shot.  Very interesting.', '2012-03-15 08:59:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710884, 1003654, 134859, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot.  It has that "old, timeless" feeling to it.  While you can see there are other objects around, houses, piers, etc., it is still, a lonely boat.  Love the color, the pp.  Good job</td>', 'I like this a lot.  It has that "old, timeless" feeling to it.  While you can see there are other objects around, houses, piers, etc., it is still, a lonely boat.  Love the color, the pp.  Good job', '2012-03-15 09:00:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710886, 1004030, 134859, '<td valign="top">I see the link to loneliness, but I just don''t feel loneliness in this photo.  Perhaps it''s just my mood right now?  <br/>However, that being said.  I think it''s a good picture.  I like the lighting, the noise works well.  It''s a good shot.</td>', 'I see the link to loneliness, but I just don''t feel loneliness in this photo.  Perhaps it''s just my mood right now?  However, that being said.  I think it''s a good picture.  I like the lighting, the noise works well.  It''s a good shot.', '2012-03-15 09:01:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710889, 1002675, 134859, '<td valign="top">Wow... this photo does display solitude.  Love the color, the processing, the dark figure skiing.  The harshness of the lighting works well.  Good shot.</td>', 'Wow... this photo does display solitude.  Love the color, the processing, the dark figure skiing.  The harshness of the lighting works well.  Good shot.', '2012-03-15 09:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710890, 1003712, 134859, '<td valign="top">This appears to be a peaceful photo... the main thing that is bothering me is that the woman is tilted.  I think if she would have been more level, it would have worked better.  The lighting works well.  ANd I love the detail of the clouds.</td>', 'This appears to be a peaceful photo... the main thing that is bothering me is that the woman is tilted.  I think if she would have been more level, it would have worked better.  The lighting works well.  ANd I love the detail of the clouds.', '2012-03-15 09:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710892, 1003928, 134859, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot.  The light is perfect for the shot.  The pose of the model is also very well done.</td>', 'This is a great shot.  The light is perfect for the shot.  The pose of the model is also very well done.', '2012-03-15 09:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710893, 1003924, 134859, '<td valign="top">A sad picture.  Nicely composed.  The woman with the napkin to her mouth is somewhat distracting, but overall, it''s well done.</td>', 'A sad picture.  Nicely composed.  The woman with the napkin to her mouth is somewhat distracting, but overall, it''s well done.', '2012-03-15 09:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710896, 1002914, 134859, '<td valign="top">Seems like he''s pondering life... the world... <br/>Great colors.  Nice detail.  The lighting seems a little off, perhaps it''s just me?  I don''t know.  <br/>Love the blurred background.  Good shot.</td>', 'Seems like he''s pondering life... the world... Great colors.  Nice detail.  The lighting seems a little off, perhaps it''s just me?  I don''t know.  Love the blurred background.  Good shot.', '2012-03-15 09:05:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710899, 1004022, 134859, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot.  Lot''s going on, but still depicts loneliness.  The stance of the bird is great.  The color contrasting each other works good.</td>', 'Very interesting shot.  Lot''s going on, but still depicts loneliness.  The stance of the bird is great.  The color contrasting each other works good.', '2012-03-15 09:06:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710900, 1004032, 134859, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.  He almost looks like he''s in despair.  Love the black and white, all the detail going on.  The angle works well.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Interesting shot.  He almost looks like he''s in despair.  Love the black and white, all the detail going on.  The angle works well.  Nicely done.', '2012-03-15 09:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710901, 1003794, 134859, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  Like the motion blur (of the lens, I''m assuming).  The guy is is perfect focus, nice detail to him.  Good choice in converting to black and white.</td>', 'Nicely done.  Like the motion blur (of the lens, I''m assuming).  The guy is is perfect focus, nice detail to him.  Good choice in converting to black and white.', '2012-03-15 09:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710902, 1003933, 134859, '<td valign="top">Awww... he looks so pitiful.  Love the detail of his fur.  The main distraction here is the doorknob.  I think if it was cropped out, it would have worked better.  Love the color, the simplicity, the sadness to his face.  Great shot.</td>', 'Awww... he looks so pitiful.  Love the detail of his fur.  The main distraction here is the doorknob.  I think if it was cropped out, it would have worked better.  Love the color, the simplicity, the sadness to his face.  Great shot.', '2012-03-15 09:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710904, 1003937, 134859, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Love the "flow" to her hair and garment.  Nice colors.  Very soft photo.  I''m guessing this portrays solitude, peace, serenity, more than loneliness?  <br/>Nice lighting as well.  Very nicely done.</td>', 'Nice shot.  Love the "flow" to her hair and garment.  Nice colors.  Very soft photo.  I''m guessing this portrays solitude, peace, serenity, more than loneliness?  Nice lighting as well.  Very nicely done.', '2012-03-15 09:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710907, 1003929, 134859, '<td valign="top">Love the colors.  The composition is great, as is the lighting.  The detail is wonderful.  Very nicely done!</td>', 'Love the colors.  The composition is great, as is the lighting.  The detail is wonderful.  Very nicely done!', '2012-03-15 09:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710924, 1003978, 134859, '<td valign="top">This is a nice photo, but a bit too simplistic.  The goose gets "lost" in the photo.  I think with a little PP, the photo really could have excelled.</td>', 'This is a nice photo, but a bit too simplistic.  The goose gets "lost" in the photo.  I think with a little PP, the photo really could have excelled.', '2012-03-15 09:21:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710945, 1003972, 134859, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.  Looks like it was taken from inside, through a window, perhaps?  I like the different and uniqueness of this photo.  Makes it more interesting.</td>', 'Interesting shot.  Looks like it was taken from inside, through a window, perhaps?  I like the different and uniqueness of this photo.  Makes it more interesting.', '2012-03-15 09:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710946, 1003397, 134859, '<td valign="top">A nice shot, but it looks a little over processed?</td>', 'A nice shot, but it looks a little over processed?', '2012-03-15 09:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710947, 1003428, 134859, '<td valign="top">I didn''t even notice the plane at first.  The picture is beautiful, with the different colors of the sunset, the softness of the tress and sky... makes the plane seem a little out of place.</td>', 'I didn''t even notice the plane at first.  The picture is beautiful, with the different colors of the sunset, the softness of the tress and sky... makes the plane seem a little out of place.', '2012-03-15 09:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710948, 1003732, 134859, '<td valign="top">I like the idea here.  The tree seems a little over exposed.  But against the blue background, it stands out well.  I think if the crop wasn''t so tight, it would have looked a little better, seems like some of the limbs were cut off with the crop.</td>', 'I like the idea here.  The tree seems a little over exposed.  But against the blue background, it stands out well.  I think if the crop wasn''t so tight, it would have looked a little better, seems like some of the limbs were cut off with the crop.', '2012-03-15 09:55:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710949, 1003858, 134859, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.  The person almost looks dead, rather than like they are swimming.  Eerie.  Like the darkness and greyscale here.  The light being shone on the person is pretty interesting.  The noise works well.  Good shot.</td>', 'Interesting shot.  The person almost looks dead, rather than like they are swimming.  Eerie.  Like the darkness and greyscale here.  The light being shone on the person is pretty interesting.  The noise works well.  Good shot.', '2012-03-15 09:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710951, 1002555, 134859, '<td valign="top">It seems like she is carrying the weight of the world on her shoulders.  I don''t think the lighting works to the advantage of the photo.  But I like the noise.  The background is also a little distracting.  But nice shot, nonetheless.</td>', 'It seems like she is carrying the weight of the world on her shoulders.  I don''t think the lighting works to the advantage of the photo.  But I like the noise.  The background is also a little distracting.  But nice shot, nonetheless.', '2012-03-15 09:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710953, 1004026, 134859, '<td valign="top">An interesting take on loneliness and solitude.  I like the shot.  It''s pretty cool.  There seems to be some dust that could have been cloned out, and I think the composition doesn''t work to the advantage of the photo.  But nice detail and interesting shot</td>', 'An interesting take on loneliness and solitude.  I like the shot.  It''s pretty cool.  There seems to be some dust that could have been cloned out, and I think the composition doesn''t work to the advantage of the photo.  But nice detail and interesting shot', '2012-03-15 09:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710955, 1004045, 134859, '<td valign="top">Seems like he''s in his own little world.  The blur of his hands gives the impression that he''s snapping, but, it takes away from the photo.  The picture also seems a little busy, with all the bright colors going on.</td>', 'Seems like he''s in his own little world.  The blur of his hands gives the impression that he''s snapping, but, it takes away from the photo.  The picture also seems a little busy, with all the bright colors going on.', '2012-03-15 09:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710957, 1004038, 134859, '<td valign="top">This is cool.  The noise makes the picture seem like it''s not a photograph, which is interesting.  <br/>I like the lone tree, composed to the left side of the frame, the colors are a little dreary, which gives an even bigger impression of loneliness, in my opinion.</td>', 'This is cool.  The noise makes the picture seem like it''s not a photograph, which is interesting.  I like the lone tree, composed to the left side of the frame, the colors are a little dreary, which gives an even bigger impression of loneliness, in my opinion.', '2012-03-15 10:00:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710959, 1004043, 134859, '<td valign="top">Strange shot, not to say I don''t like it.  The composition and oddness to this photograph makes it abstract.  It''s really different, which makes me look at it even longer, appreciate it even more.  The slight vignette works well.</td>', 'Strange shot, not to say I don''t like it.  The composition and oddness to this photograph makes it abstract.  It''s really different, which makes me look at it even longer, appreciate it even more.  The slight vignette works well.', '2012-03-15 10:01:09.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(6710961, 1002701, 134859, '<td valign="top">Haha.  This is great.  The two lego people in the foreground, dancing(?), then the lone lego guy, gazing upon them, wishing he had someone to hold.  The legos are a little dirty, guessing they get played with a lot.  But I like the idea here... it''s out of the box!</td>', 'Haha.  This is great.  The two lego people in the foreground, dancing(?), then the lone lego guy, gazing upon them, wishing he had someone to hold.  The legos are a little dirty, guessing they get played with a lot.  But I like the idea here... it''s out of the box!', '2012-03-15 10:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710962, 1003634, 134859, '<td valign="top">Is that a real duck?  It looks fake.  <br/>The shot is not bad... but it doesn''t give the "lonely" appearance.  Maybe a different angle, or a wider shot?  <br/>The colors contrasting off the white snow look good.  The detail is also nice (but not sure why the tail feathers are blurred?)<br/> <br/>Overall, a good shot.</td>', 'Is that a real duck?  It looks fake.  The shot is not bad... but it doesn''t give the "lonely" appearance.  Maybe a different angle, or a wider shot?  The colors contrasting off the white snow look good.  The detail is also nice (but not sure why the tail feathers are blurred?) Overall, a good shot.', '2012-03-15 10:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710963, 1003221, 134859, '<td valign="top">This is definitely unique.  Love the torn jeans and loose laces.  The blur makes the shot even more eye-catching.  The black and white with grain/noise also works for the picture.  Good job</td>', 'This is definitely unique.  Love the torn jeans and loose laces.  The blur makes the shot even more eye-catching.  The black and white with grain/noise also works for the picture.  Good job', '2012-03-15 10:04:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710965, 1004048, 134859, '<td valign="top">A bright contrast.  But I think it''s a little too much of a close up?  The lighting is somewhat harsh.  But a nice attempt.</td>', 'A bright contrast.  But I think it''s a little too much of a close up?  The lighting is somewhat harsh.  But a nice attempt.', '2012-03-15 10:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710967, 1003874, 134859, '<td valign="top">Too much green for me, and the DOF is throwing me off. I get the link and it''s a good idea.</td>', 'Too much green for me, and the DOF is throwing me off. I get the link and it''s a good idea.', '2012-03-15 10:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710968, 1003443, 134859, '<td valign="top">A nice shot.  Like the lighting that highlights her hair.  She seems to be in her own little world.  The colors seem a little flat, though.</td>', 'A nice shot.  Like the lighting that highlights her hair.  She seems to be in her own little world.  The colors seem a little flat, though.', '2012-03-15 10:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710969, 1003837, 134859, '<td valign="top">Not too fond of the red/pink.  I think if it was a total black and white, it would have really looked good.  I like the detail of the stone.</td>', 'Not too fond of the red/pink.  I think if it was a total black and white, it would have really looked good.  I like the detail of the stone.', '2012-03-15 10:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710973, 1004050, 134859, '<td valign="top">The statue seems a little unlevel.  Not sure that I like the people in motion/blurred slighting.  <br/>However, the one guy, standing to the left side, that''s a good focal point for the challenge.  Perhaps if that was your main focus, the picture would have appealed to *me* more.  There''s just some "off-ness" to this shot, in my opinion.</td>', 'The statue seems a little unlevel.  Not sure that I like the people in motion/blurred slighting.  However, the one guy, standing to the left side, that''s a good focal point for the challenge.  Perhaps if that was your main focus, the picture would have appealed to *me* more.  There''s just some "off-ness" to this shot, in my opinion.', '2012-03-15 10:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710975, 1003305, 134859, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of this shot.  Perhaps is she wasn''t so saturated with color, maybe a slight desat of the picture, or a complete black and white?  Just my opinion, though</td>', 'I like the idea of this shot.  Perhaps is she wasn''t so saturated with color, maybe a slight desat of the picture, or a complete black and white?  Just my opinion, though', '2012-03-15 10:16:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710976, 1003076, 134859, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot... the softness with the darkness.  There seems to be a dark shadow around the person, which is strange.  The DOF is alright.  The colors work pretty well.  And I''m still trying to figure out what that thing is to the right of the photo, laying in the tall grass.</td>', 'Interesting shot... the softness with the darkness.  There seems to be a dark shadow around the person, which is strange.  The DOF is alright.  The colors work pretty well.  And I''m still trying to figure out what that thing is to the right of the photo, laying in the tall grass.', '2012-03-15 10:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710977, 1003564, 134859, '<td valign="top">Aww... chained up.  Nice colors.  Good lighting.  Nice detail as well.  I think the crop is a little too tight, but that''s just my opinion</td>', 'Aww... chained up.  Nice colors.  Good lighting.  Nice detail as well.  I think the crop is a little too tight, but that''s just my opinion', '2012-03-15 10:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710978, 1003651, 134859, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot.  Like the snow falling, it works well here.</td>', 'Lovely shot.  Like the snow falling, it works well here.', '2012-03-15 10:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710980, 1003953, 134859, '<td valign="top">A little over processed for my liking.  I didn''t even notice the duck till I almost left the photo.  Good idea, just a little dark, I think</td>', 'A little over processed for my liking.  I didn''t even notice the duck till I almost left the photo.  Good idea, just a little dark, I think', '2012-03-15 10:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710981, 1002757, 134859, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.  This would have been an awesome shot for the sunrise/sunset in black and white (minus the plane).  Love the colors, the wideness of the shot.  It''s pretty to look at , but I''m not feeling the plane in the shot.  Just my opinion, though</td>', 'Nice colors.  This would have been an awesome shot for the sunrise/sunset in black and white (minus the plane).  Love the colors, the wideness of the shot.  It''s pretty to look at , but I''m not feeling the plane in the shot.  Just my opinion, though', '2012-03-15 10:20:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710982, 1004046, 134859, '<td valign="top">This is interesting.  A shadow of loneliness.  I like the composition, the darkness of the majority of the picture, with a splice of color and subject.  Good shot.</td>', 'This is interesting.  A shadow of loneliness.  I like the composition, the darkness of the majority of the picture, with a splice of color and subject.  Good shot.', '2012-03-15 10:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710984, 1003620, 134859, '<td valign="top">A good shot, but seems a little dark and the colors a little drab.  The sharpness of the flower doesn''t seem to be there, either.  Good choice, but I believe with a few minor adjustments, the photo could have really come to life.</td>', 'A good shot, but seems a little dark and the colors a little drab.  The sharpness of the flower doesn''t seem to be there, either.  Good choice, but I believe with a few minor adjustments, the photo could have really come to life.', '2012-03-15 10:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710985, 1004009, 134859, '<td valign="top">Love the title with combination of the photo.  I think the background is a little distracting... but it also adds detail (story) to the picture.  Good choice here.</td>', 'Love the title with combination of the photo.  I think the background is a little distracting... but it also adds detail (story) to the picture.  Good choice here.', '2012-03-15 10:22:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710986, 1003954, 134859, '<td valign="top">Nice shot and good motion blur/lens effect.  I like the black and white and the way the picture makes your eyes focus on the little boy (which is the point of the photo).</td>', 'Nice shot and good motion blur/lens effect.  I like the black and white and the way the picture makes your eyes focus on the little boy (which is the point of the photo).', '2012-03-15 10:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710987, 1003984, 134859, '<td valign="top">Hmmm... different.  <br/>Like the ducky, as well as the Earth and Moon far away.</td>', 'Hmmm... different.  Like the ducky, as well as the Earth and Moon far away.', '2012-03-15 10:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6710989, 1003077, 134859, '<td valign="top">Beautiful close up, nice vibrant colors.  Love the detail as well.</td>', 'Beautiful close up, nice vibrant colors.  Love the detail as well.', '2012-03-15 10:24:10.000000', NULL, 1),
