(6713371, 1003920, 30982, '<td valign="top">Not sure of your title, but I really like the picture.  Works well for this challenge.</td>', 'Not sure of your title, but I really like the picture.  Works well for this challenge.', '2012-03-16 22:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713372, 1002907, 30982, '<td valign="top">One of the strongest for this challenge theme.  There''s hope, though - he has flowers!</td>', 'One of the strongest for this challenge theme.  There''s hope, though - he has flowers!', '2012-03-16 22:29:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713375, 1003778, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nice sense of isolation created both by the light and placement of the tomb.</td>', 'Very nice sense of isolation created both by the light and placement of the tomb.', '2012-03-16 22:30:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713377, 1003928, 30982, '<td valign="top">Beautiful use of light.</td>', 'Beautiful use of light.', '2012-03-16 22:31:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713380, 1003651, 30982, '<td valign="top">Card-worthy.  I can see the inside sentiment as "Having a wonderful time - wish you were here!"</td>', 'Card-worthy.  I can see the inside sentiment as "Having a wonderful time - wish you were here!"', '2012-03-16 22:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713383, 1003753, 30982, '<td valign="top">Beauty of a cat, and love the light on the whiskers!  Best part, though, is that little window with the lace curtains.</td>', 'Beauty of a cat, and love the light on the whiskers!  Best part, though, is that little window with the lace curtains.', '2012-03-16 22:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713384, 1003851, 30982, '<td valign="top">Tiny little thing - delicate little photograph - nicely done!</td>', 'Tiny little thing - delicate little photograph - nicely done!', '2012-03-16 22:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713385, 1004032, 30982, '<td valign="top">A perfect title.</td>', 'A perfect title.', '2012-03-16 22:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713387, 1003309, 30982, '<td valign="top">She stands out in a crowd - very pretty woman.</td>', 'She stands out in a crowd - very pretty woman.', '2012-03-16 22:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713390, 1003969, 30982, '<td valign="top">I love his intensity!  Not sure about the blur to the right.</td>', 'I love his intensity!  Not sure about the blur to the right.', '2012-03-16 22:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713393, 1004002, 30982, '<td valign="top">Love the contrast of her situation and the windows she chose to sit in front of.   Interesting choice to make her "world" bleak and monochrome leaving the rest so very colorful.</td>', 'Love the contrast of her situation and the windows she chose to sit in front of.   Interesting choice to make her "world" bleak and monochrome leaving the rest so very colorful.', '2012-03-16 22:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713512, 1004026, 133107, '<td valign="top">The hourglass is wonderful and the compositions is terrific although the reflections in the glass are not ideal.  Nice detail in the grain of the wood and the sand but odd marks around the wood in the bg.<br/>Time passing does not evoke aloneness for me but there is a peacefulness to the image that is calming and peaceful.</td>', 'The hourglass is wonderful and the compositions is terrific although the reflections in the glass are not ideal.  Nice detail in the grain of the wood and the sand but odd marks around the wood in the bg.Time passing does not evoke aloneness for me but there is a peacefulness to the image that is calming and peaceful.', '2012-03-16 23:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713526, 1004038, 133107, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely scene with the solitary tree and no one to be seen in this image.    The mountains as they meet the sea are particularly appealing.<br/>Problems:  the fg looks like some kind of parking lot and perhaps could be cropped out.<br/>The sky has a lot of noise.  Perhaps a de-noise program could be used.</td>', 'This is a lovely scene with the solitary tree and no one to be seen in this image.    The mountains as they meet the sea are particularly appealing.Problems:  the fg looks like some kind of parking lot and perhaps could be cropped out.The sky has a lot of noise.  Perhaps a de-noise program could be used.', '2012-03-16 23:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713811, 1004003, 141319, '<td valign="top">Gruesome but VERY powerful and great image</td>', 'Gruesome but VERY powerful and great image', '2012-03-17 04:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713815, 1003969, 141319, '<td valign="top">Seems to me like he is just out of focus? I would have preferred if the focus was him and/or the image a bit crisper. Lovely composition though and great for this challenge, also like the crop</td>', 'Seems to me like he is just out of focus? I would have preferred if the focus was him and/or the image a bit crisper. Lovely composition though and great for this challenge, also like the crop', '2012-03-17 04:20:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713816, 1003666, 141319, '<td valign="top">Love the composition (especially the little twigs around her) but think it would have been nicer with the light from the other side (i.e on her face)</td>', 'Love the composition (especially the little twigs around her) but think it would have been nicer with the light from the other side (i.e on her face)', '2012-03-17 04:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713821, 1004038, 67258, '<td valign="top">Like the composition and the feeling evoked, love the colour palette and the graininess.  Not so keen on the sharpness and the haloing.</td>', 'Like the composition and the feeling evoked, love the colour palette and the graininess.  Not so keen on the sharpness and the haloing.', '2012-03-17 04:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713907, 1003924, 109227, '<td valign="top">Great candid image. (voted earlier)</td>', 'Great candid image. (voted earlier)', '2012-03-17 09:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713908, 1003710, 109227, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light and you captured it well. (voted earlier)</td>', 'Beautiful light and you captured it well. (voted earlier)', '2012-03-17 09:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713909, 1003998, 141319, '<td valign="top">I find the strip in the forground somewhat distracting, I like the rest of the image and composition. the lines work really well</td>', 'I find the strip in the forground somewhat distracting, I like the rest of the image and composition. the lines work really well', '2012-03-17 09:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713910, 1003857, 109227, '<td valign="top">Lovely setting and nice tones and does say "alone in a vast world".  IMO, less sky or less beach would give a better perspective.  Nice none-the-less.</td>', 'Lovely setting and nice tones and does say "alone in a vast world".  IMO, less sky or less beach would give a better perspective.  Nice none-the-less.', '2012-03-17 09:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713912, 1003607, 109227, '<td valign="top">Alone, yet not.  Nice take on the challenge. (voted earlier)</td>', 'Alone, yet not.  Nice take on the challenge. (voted earlier)', '2012-03-17 09:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713916, 1004007, 141319, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of this image, but for me the lighting doesn''t work. He looks like he is standing in a "well lit area" which is in contradiction with the title and I think intention of the picture. I do like the composition though.</td>', 'I like the idea of this image, but for me the lighting doesn''t work. He looks like he is standing in a "well lit area" which is in contradiction with the title and I think intention of the picture. I do like the composition though.', '2012-03-17 09:11:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713919, 1003221, 141319, '<td valign="top">Interesting, different,</td>', 'Interesting, different,', '2012-03-17 09:13:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713923, 1003851, 141319, '<td valign="top">Nice colour combination, he realy "jumps out". Nice DOF. I would have given him a little more space on the right</td>', 'Nice colour combination, he realy "jumps out". Nice DOF. I would have given him a little more space on the right', '2012-03-17 09:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713927, 1003847, 141319, '<td valign="top">WOW! stunning photograph</td>', 'WOW! stunning photograph', '2012-03-17 09:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6713932, 1004049, 141319, '<td valign="top">Cute idea, nice photograph, I like composition and DOF. Only comment is that the pawn looks like it is a brush holder of some sort and I was quite confused initially as to what this actually is. I can see now on the top is the reflection of the other pieces, still don''t know what the "neck" part is ... Makes an otherwise really good picture confusing (at least for me :-))</td>', 'Cute idea, nice photograph, I like composition and DOF. Only comment is that the pawn looks like it is a brush holder of some sort and I was quite confused initially as to what this actually is. I can see now on the top is the reflection of the other pieces, still don''t know what the "neck" part is ... Makes an otherwise really good picture confusing (at least for me :-))', '2012-03-17 09:22:58.000000', NULL, 1),
