(6715624, 1003712, 46202, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by LydiaToo:</b></div><hr/><i> The title reinforces the fact that she is content... <br/> <br/>Not at all lonely, as the challenge topic and <b>description</b> require.<br/> <br/>(commenting only) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thank you for taking the time to comment, LydiaToo.  While I agree that the challenge stipulated "loneliness", which indeed has negative connotation, to me, "solitude" also stipulated in the challenge description), is not relegated to sadness or negative connotation.  Sometimes an evening spent in your favorite place by yourself is exactly what you need.  :O)</td>', 'Originally posted by LydiaToo: The title reinforces the fact that she is content...  Not at all lonely, as the challenge topic and description require. (commenting only)   Thank you for taking the time to comment, LydiaToo.  While I agree that the challenge stipulated "loneliness", which indeed has negative connotation, to me, "solitude" also stipulated in the challenge description), is not relegated to sadness or negative connotation.  Sometimes an evening spent in your favorite place by yourself is exactly what you need.  :O)', '2012-03-19 00:12:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(6715625, 1003928, 58785, '<td valign="top">I don''t know... nothing wrong with the first two places, good image, but for me, this is the winner (in a better spot) :-\<br/>very nice moody picture.</td>', 'I don''t know... nothing wrong with the first two places, good image, but for me, this is the winner (in a better spot) :-\very nice moody picture.', '2012-03-19 00:12:55.000000', NULL, 0),
