(6715665, 1003854, 138253, '<td valign="top">Camera diopter out of focus slightly causing carpet to gain the focus.... couldn''t get dog back in place with same look so I went ahead with it hoping people wouldn''t be overly harsh (and they were not, so thank you!!)</td>', 'Camera diopter out of focus slightly causing carpet to gain the focus.... couldn''t get dog back in place with same look so I went ahead with it hoping people wouldn''t be overly harsh (and they were not, so thank you!!)', '2012-03-19 00:29:25.000000', NULL, 0),
