(6715934, 1003712, 14001, '<td valign="top">This was my favorite image in the contest, the composition, the colors and the lighting setup.  How did you do the lighting by the way?  Thanks for the effort, it''s not that I don''t love shots of pickles on a table (that normally win these contests), but I do really enjoy these types of pictures.  There is so much work involved, yet it seems to go unnoticed.  One requirement to me is, "Would I put this on my wall?", and this clearly meets that!  Nice work.</td>', 'This was my favorite image in the contest, the composition, the colors and the lighting setup.  How did you do the lighting by the way?  Thanks for the effort, it''s not that I don''t love shots of pickles on a table (that normally win these contests), but I do really enjoy these types of pictures.  There is so much work involved, yet it seems to go unnoticed.  One requirement to me is, "Would I put this on my wall?", and this clearly meets that!  Nice work.', '2012-03-19 08:45:43.000000', NULL, 0),
