(6716715, 1003928, 94815, '<td valign="top">Really well done and contrats. I gave it a 7, and I not only know the AA Milne  poem but can sing it from a memory of 60 years ago from a David Tomlinson album. Funny, actually, when I can''t remember what I did five minutes ago.</td>', 'Really well done and contrats. I gave it a 7, and I not only know the AA Milne  poem but can sing it from a memory of 60 years ago from a David Tomlinson album. Funny, actually, when I can''t remember what I did five minutes ago.', '2012-03-19 17:40:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(6716718, 1004009, 49018, '<td valign="top">I found it touching actually. Reminded me of desolated summers in empty cities, the torrid heat creeping on the concrete and bending light. Milan, in northern Italy, would fit the bill well.<br/>Good stuff.</td>', 'I found it touching actually. Reminded me of desolated summers in empty cities, the torrid heat creeping on the concrete and bending light. Milan, in northern Italy, would fit the bill well.Good stuff.', '2012-03-19 17:48:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(6716719, 1004030, 49018, '<td valign="top">That''s really good stuff.</td>', 'That''s really good stuff.', '2012-03-19 17:49:51.000000', NULL, 0),
