(6716743, 1003841, 138630, '<td valign="top">I loved this image and gave it a 9 -- hard to believe only one other person did.  I ran out of time and didn''t comment but I thought it fit the challenge well.  It''s true that many of the entries were on the sad or depressing side of "alone", but the challenge description said "a feeling of loneliness or solitude" so I had no problem with your interpretation.  I love the angle, the detail is great, and you were both obviously up early and taking advantage of the hour.  Very nice capture IMO</td>', 'I loved this image and gave it a 9 -- hard to believe only one other person did.  I ran out of time and didn''t comment but I thought it fit the challenge well.  It''s true that many of the entries were on the sad or depressing side of "alone", but the challenge description said "a feeling of loneliness or solitude" so I had no problem with your interpretation.  I love the angle, the detail is great, and you were both obviously up early and taking advantage of the hour.  Very nice capture IMO', '2012-03-19 18:21:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(6716748, 1003999, 11769, '<td valign="top">Just hanging around. Cute.</td>', 'Just hanging around. Cute.', '2012-03-19 18:23:44.000000', NULL, 0),
