(6716857, 1003841, 27605, '<td valign="top">I didn''t vote in the challenge, but in answer to your thread questioning the score, I think this failed to break into the top tier (i.e. above 6) because the bird fills much of the frame and therefore the feeling of being alone is minimized.  In other words I think you needed more expanse to accentuate the single pelican.  Also I sometimes like the tilted perspective shots, but this one I think would be better with a close to horizontal horizon.<br/> <br/>All of that said, if I had voted I probably would have given this a 6, and probably higher in a different challenge.  It''s a photo to be proud of, for sure.</td>', 'I didn''t vote in the challenge, but in answer to your thread questioning the score, I think this failed to break into the top tier (i.e. above 6) because the bird fills much of the frame and therefore the feeling of being alone is minimized.  In other words I think you needed more expanse to accentuate the single pelican.  Also I sometimes like the tilted perspective shots, but this one I think would be better with a close to horizontal horizon. All of that said, if I had voted I probably would have given this a 6, and probably higher in a different challenge.  It''s a photo to be proud of, for sure.', '2012-03-19 20:30:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(6716860, 1002907, 114285, '<td valign="top">Hey your first ribbon, well done, I love the way you PP this.</td>', 'Hey your first ribbon, well done, I love the way you PP this.', '2012-03-19 20:31:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(6716879, 1003861, 142483, '<td valign="top">Ha, glad I didnt enter the only shot I took for this challenge - while doing a photoshoot for a friend and her three year old daughter, I had the daughter stand by herself with a teddy hanging by her side and "look sad"... the result was about 10 smirk photos, where she was trying not to smile, and one overly dramatic soap opera style sad expression haha. She didnt understand, she''s always told to smile for the camera?? Your''s turned out MUCH better than mine haha well done</td>', 'Ha, glad I didnt enter the only shot I took for this challenge - while doing a photoshoot for a friend and her three year old daughter, I had the daughter stand by herself with a teddy hanging by her side and "look sad"... the result was about 10 smirk photos, where she was trying not to smile, and one overly dramatic soap opera style sad expression haha. She didnt understand, she''s always told to smile for the camera?? Your''s turned out MUCH better than mine haha well done', '2012-03-19 20:48:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(6716939, 1003633, 30982, '<td valign="top">Sweet light!  I thought it a coiled bird at first, though that made no sense whatsoever.</td>', 'Sweet light!  I thought it a coiled bird at first, though that made no sense whatsoever.', '2012-03-19 21:50:57.000000', NULL, 0),
