(6717726, 1003997, 14001, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by LoVi:</b></div><hr/><i> sunk her battleship.......................shame on you<br/> <br/>please tell me that''s not what happened?<br/> <br/>you never did tell us......aside from the technical stuff....... </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>No, this was just an idea that was conceived from the fact that my kids get so lonely when one of them is not around, and I liked the additional drama with the photo over her shoulder that she may be permanently gone.<br/> <br/>Thanks for your interest and comments.   My kids loved helping me with this shot, and I''m thrilled that a few of you understood it.  Thanks!</td>', 'Originally posted by LoVi: sunk her battleship.......................shame on you please tell me that''s not what happened? you never did tell us......aside from the technical stuff.......   No, this was just an idea that was conceived from the fact that my kids get so lonely when one of them is not around, and I liked the additional drama with the photo over her shoulder that she may be permanently gone. Thanks for your interest and comments.   My kids loved helping me with this shot, and I''m thrilled that a few of you understood it.  Thanks!', '2012-03-20 19:23:44.000000', NULL, 0);
