(6722584, 1003856, 131284, '<td valign="top">Whether a homage or a coincidence this is very similar to one of Rui Palha''s better known images "<a href="//ruipalha.portfolio.artlimited.net/image/en/240079" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">We Are So Little #2</a>". Still, I love all these images putting mankinds scale in to perspective :). Congrats on the blue!</td>', 'Whether a homage or a coincidence this is very similar to one of Rui Palha''s better known images "We Are So Little #2". Still, I love all these images putting mankinds scale in to perspective :). Congrats on the blue!', '2012-03-25 19:12:20.000000', NULL, 0),
