(6723057, 1003428, 12611, '<td valign="top">I like this one very much, its a shot to stop a while on. At first I thought the darkness in the  front was awkward. But as I continued looking I realized the sense that I was getting was not a criticism of the shot and composition, but a dark and uncomfortable loneliness. And when a shot can make you feel like it is supposed to, thats pretty good. If you have to sacrifice the "wow factor" for that, don''t hesitate to do it every time.</td>', 'I like this one very much, its a shot to stop a while on. At first I thought the darkness in the  front was awkward. But as I continued looking I realized the sense that I was getting was not a criticism of the shot and composition, but a dark and uncomfortable loneliness. And when a shot can make you feel like it is supposed to, thats pretty good. If you have to sacrifice the "wow factor" for that, don''t hesitate to do it every time.', '2012-03-26 10:06:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(6739691, 1003682, 120171, '<td valign="top">I like this shot and agree a wider/landscape format would have worked better in the challenge. Don''t you just hate when civilisation gets in the way of a good shot.</td>', 'I like this shot and agree a wider/landscape format would have worked better in the challenge. Don''t you just hate when civilisation gets in the way of a good shot.', '2012-04-12 16:52:30.000000', NULL, 0),
