(6741685, 1003682, 143086, '<td valign="top">I like the trees in the foreground. I like the patches of direct sunlight too. If the cabin (shed) had windows, the image would be more poignant I think.</td>', 'I like the trees in the foreground. I like the patches of direct sunlight too. If the cabin (shed) had windows, the image would be more poignant I think.', '2012-04-14 20:44:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(6742873, 1003682, 97225, '<td valign="top">I like the tangle of woods around the little cabin and the almost monochrome colour range. Maybe a slightly different viewpoint could have placed the cabin higher or lower than it is for a more interesting composition.</td>', 'I like the tangle of woods around the little cabin and the almost monochrome colour range. Maybe a slightly different viewpoint could have placed the cabin higher or lower than it is for a more interesting composition.', '2012-04-16 03:50:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(6776977, 1003947, 33068, '<td valign="top">Love the emotion you captured in this shot.</td>', 'Love the emotion you captured in this shot.', '2012-05-23 22:58:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(6807908, 1003620, 68947, '<td valign="top">Maybe, I don''t have an eye for photography anymore but, I don''t get why the seed pod on the ground did better than this NOR, do I get why this was considered "too dark" when half of what goes on the front page is this type of tone.  *SIGH*  <br/> <br/>I happen to like this shot, Jo.  Good job!<br/> <br/>ETA:  On second thought...I don''t get why 3/4''s of the ones that ranked above this one got where they did and this one beneath them?????  <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2012-07-03 17:54:32.</i></td>', 'Maybe, I don''t have an eye for photography anymore but, I don''t get why the seed pod on the ground did better than this NOR, do I get why this was considered "too dark" when half of what goes on the front page is this type of tone.  *SIGH*   I happen to like this shot, Jo.  Good job! ETA:  On second thought...I don''t get why 3/4''s of the ones that ranked above this one got where they did and this one beneath them?????  ', '2012-07-03 18:51:49.000000', '2012-07-03 18:54:32.000000', 0),
(6807911, 1003969, 68947, '<td valign="top">I think this was beautifully done and I don''t get why this one wasn''t up in the top 5...heck...the top 3????  Congratulations on a beautiful piece!</td>', 'I think this was beautifully done and I don''t get why this one wasn''t up in the top 5...heck...the top 3????  Congratulations on a beautiful piece!', '2012-07-03 18:57:04.000000', NULL, 0),
